  "prefLabel": "Plc 1204.05 Initial Review of Applications for Initial Licensure; Abandonment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1204.05 Initial Review of Applications for Initial Licensure; Abandonment.\n\n(a) Within 30 days of receipt of an application submitted pursuant to Plc 1204.02, the licensing bureau shall process the application as provided in Plc 304.06.\n\n(b) The application shall be subject to the abandonment provisions of Plc 304.06(h).\n\n(c) If the application is abandoned, the application processing and licensing fee shall not be refunded.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1200) #13704, eff 8-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1200.html"
